  "body": "Firstly, in \"process a navigate fetch\", responseCOOP is not presently\ndeclared, but variables must not be used before they are declared:\nhttps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#variables\n\nSecondly, the \"current origin\" item of cross-origin opener policy\nenforcement result is called \"origin\" at all other uses. The definition\nis renamed to be consistent with the references, and with the \"url\"\nitem, which is similarly not qualified as \"current\".\n\nCOOP support landed in 0666f4eb5.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7082/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 20, 2021, 6:20 PM UTC (cab1eb5)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7082/75254d9...cab1eb5/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 20, 2021, 6:20 PM UTC (cab1eb5)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7082/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 20, 2021, 6:20 PM UTC (cab1eb5)\">/origin.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7082/75254d9...cab1eb5/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 20, 2021, 6:20 PM UTC (cab1eb5)\">diff</a> )",
